            <div xml:id="d685">

                <pb facs="0738" n="724" sameAs="frus:frus1942v06/pg724"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">833.51/1001: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Uruguay</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Dawson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-10-10T13:00:00-04:00">October 10, 1942—1
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>610. Your A–81, September 26, noon. Department prefers that matter be taken up by
                    Uruguayan Government through its Embassy in Washington.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Welles</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
